# Python Imports

All `import` and `from ... import ...` statements belong at the top of the file.

Allowed order:

1. `from __future__ import ...`
2. Module docstring (if present)
3. All imports, grouped and alphabetized by `pythonImportStyle.py`
4. Everything else (constants, helpers, classes, functions)

Never add inline imports. Enforced by `tools/lint/pythonImportStyle.py` (`npm run lint:py`).
